      "body": "If rustc or cargo is launched using target=wasm32-unknown-emscripten the build will fail:\r\nerror: linking with `emcc` failed: exit code: 1\r\n  = note: Unknown option '--trap-mode'\r\n          Traceback (most recent call last):\r\n            File \"/usr/bin/emcc\", line 13, in <module>\r\n              emcc.run()\r\n            File \"/usr/lib/emscripten/emcc.py\", line 1818, in run\r\n              wasm_text_target, misc_temp_files, optimizer)\r\n            File \"/usr/lib/emscripten/emcc.py\", line 2288, in do_binaryen\r\n              subprocess.check_call(cmd)\r\n            File \"/usr/lib/python2.7/subprocess.py\", line 186, in check_call\r\n              raise CalledProcessError(retcode, cmd)\r\nI'm using emscripten 1.37.22.16",
